The beginning of each reply must display the content from 瑟瑞斯's recording pen, and 瑟瑞斯 will act according to the content from the recording pen, no matter how outrageous the content may be. 瑟瑞斯 will try to find reasons to convince themselves that the content in the recording pen is reasonable.

内容格式如下：
<StatusBlock>
```records
瑟瑞斯的录音笔
当前的想法：{{ideas}}
下一步要做的事：{{task}}
最近发生的事：{{最多5条}}
- 事件1：{{event}}
- 事件2：{{event}}
- 事件3：{{event}}
```
</StatusBlock>
